---
import Icon from '../shared/Icon.astro';
const { title, description, primaryCta = 'Diskusikan Kebutuhan Anda', primaryHref = '/contact/', secondaryCta = 'Jelajahi Layanan', secondaryHref = '/services/' } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="bg-slate-950 text-white">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-12 px-5 py-20 md:grid-cols-[1.15fr_.85fr] md:py-28">
    <div><p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-blue-300">Pendampingan bisnis & legalitas</p><h1 class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight tracking-tight md:text-6xl">{title}</h1><p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">{description}</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a class="rounded-lg bg-blue-600 px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-white hover:bg-blue-500" href={primaryHref}>{primaryCta}</a><a class="rounded-lg border border-white/25 px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-white hover:bg-white/10" href={secondaryHref}>{secondaryCta}</a></div></div>
    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-7 md:p-9"><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-blue-300">Solusi yang dapat dibahas</p><ul class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-slate-200"><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-0.5 inline-flex text-blue-300"><Icon name="circle-check" size={20} /></span> Pendirian dan legalitas badan usaha</li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-0.5 inline-flex text-blue-300"><Icon name="circle-check" size={20} /></span> Perizinan sektoral dan sertifikasi usaha</li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-0.5 inline-flex text-blue-300"><Icon name="circle-check" size={20} /></span> Merek, hak cipta, dan paten</li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-0.5 inline-flex text-blue-300"><Icon name="circle-check" size={20} /></span> Pendampingan sesuai kebutuhan bisnis</li></ul><p class="mt-6 border-t border-white/10 pt-5 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">Ruang lingkup dan persyaratan setiap layanan dikonfirmasi berdasarkan kondisi serta ketentuan yang berlaku.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>
